			<div class="content" id="post-content-2404560">
									

<p>This is a story about rendering visible those things that are invisible. Appropriately, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/faminepulse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1359534); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1359534&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1447060610" alt="Faminepulse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1359534)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/faminepulse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1359534); return false;">Faminepulse</a></span> has promised a picture of the anomaly if this survives long enough. Until then, you'll just have to grin and bear it :)</p>
<p><strong>Attributions:</strong> Very many thanks to:</p>
<ul>
<li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/randomini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1379080); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1379080&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1447060610" alt="Randomini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1379080)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/randomini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1379080); return false;">Randomini</a></span> for letting me use Agent Green. My headcanon is that this is set a little before <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/the-cool-war-hub">The Cool War</a>.</li>
<li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/twistedgears" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735681); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735681&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1447060610" alt="TwistedGears" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735681)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/twistedgears" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735681); return false;">TwistedGears</a></span> for letting me use Agent Navarro, who turns up more in the supplemental tale.</li>
</ul>
<p>It is a privilege to be allowed to take such great characters out for a spin, and I really appreciated your feedback and guidance on the first draft of this.</p>
<p><strong>Acknowledgements:</strong> Thanks also to everyone who reviewed this on the forums and chat. Decibelles, WrongJohnSilver, Dr Hood and Dr Solo. And a particular thanks to sirpudding, who actually went hiking in the State Park in which this SCP is set, and took a whole pile of photos there. Sorry I haven't been able to use them yet!</p>
<p>The story continues in the tale <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/figure-and-ground">linked at the end of the draft</a>.</p>

