<p>Hi Gaffney - sorry you didn't enjoy it, but I really appreciate you telling me why. And no need to apologise for the puns - I thought they were a gas.</p>
<p>I'm particularly sorry that you didn't get any striking images from the article. It might be that adding a picture would help - probably in a second collapsible immediately after the interview. That might provide slightly more payoff too, if that's what you're missing - I agree with you that this needs to stand on its own, despite the larger story being in the tale.</p>
<p>I don't understand your references to &quot;killbot&quot; (and the accompanying reveal you expected) - it would be great if you could explain what you meant by that.</p>

