<p>In this case, I see the value of a visual - because what's been described here is a giant, crudely-drawn teenager's depiction of a penis. Sure, it's a titanic penis that replaces the normal atmosphere in its area with pure nitrogen, even supplies of air in tanks, but it is what it is - a sort of My First Anart thing. If the kid weren't an anartist, he'd be drawing these penises on posters and bathroom walls and such.</p>
<p>That actually kind of adds to the skip for me, the fact that it is indeed so very crude. We've been shown bad anart before, but it always wanted to <em>say</em> something, where this is anartistic graffiti - and crude, childish graffiti at that.</p>

